{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"9c97f8df-b00f-48f2-88ea-8b9d4ab81766","step":{"id":"s1","script":"Torque measures a force’s turning effect. Here, a twenty-newton force pushes upward on a bar that can rotate about the pivot.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Torque: the turning effect"},{"op":"figure","id":"bar","region":"right","frame":{"x":[-0.8,4.2],"y":[-1,3],"axes":"none"},"marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"rod","from":[0,0],"to":[3.7,0]},{"kind":"point","id":"pivot","at":[0,0],"label":"pivot"},{"kind":"point","id":"contact","at":[3,0]},{"kind":"segment","id":"force","from":{"at":"contact"},"to":[3,2],"arrow":true,"label":"20 N"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"9c97f8df-b00f-48f2-88ea-8b9d4ab81766","step":{"id":"s2","script":"The lever arm is the perpendicular distance from the pivot to the force’s line of action—not always the length of the bar.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"lever_marks","on":"bar","marks":[{"kind":"segment","id":"action","from":[3,-0.8],"to":[3,2.6],"stroke":"dashed"},{"kind":"measure","from":[0,-0.55],"to":[3,-0.55],"label":"3 m"},{"kind":"angle","at":{"at":"contact"},"from":[3,1],"to":{"at":"pivot"},"r":0.12,"label":"90°"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"rule","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"\\tau=F d_{\\perp}"}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.warning","request_id":"9c97f8df-b00f-48f2-88ea-8b9d4ab81766","code":"step_repaired","step_hint":"s3"}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"9c97f8df-b00f-48f2-88ea-8b9d4ab81766","step":{"id":"s3","script":"Multiply force by perpendicular lever arm: sixty newton-meters, counterclockwise. Moving the same force closer to the pivot reduces its turning effect.","ops":[{"op":"figure","id":"turn_marks","on":"bar","marks":[{"kind":"arc","center":{"at":"pivot"},"r":0.75,"start":15,"end":110,"arrow":true,"label":"↶"},{"kind":"text","at":[1.4,2.6],"text":"60 N·m"}]},{"op":"equation","id":"result","anchor":{"el":"rule","side":"below","gap":0.1},"latex":"\\tau=(20\\,\\mathrm{N})(3\\,\\mathrm{m})=60\\,\\mathrm{N\\,m}"}],"checkpoint":null}}
